     2044                   , output v-void-string
     2045               ).
     2046               run bgelib-write-footer in this-procedure (
     2047                     input no
     2048                   , input v-prev-filename
     2049                   , input p-list-file-name
     2050                   , input yes
     2051                   , input p-xml-file-name + "xml":U
     2052               ).
