     2243               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "paymentCode",          input string( buf_trn-doc.pay-code                    ), input 0 ).
     2244               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "InterFirmDocChild",    input string( buf_trn-doc.hold-doc-code-child         ), input 0 ).
     2245               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "InterFirmDocParent",   input string( buf_trn-doc.hold-doc-code-parent        ), input 0 ).
     2246               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "InterFirmObjType",     input string( buf_trn-doc.hold-obj-type               ), input 0 ).
     2247               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "InterFirmObjCode",     input string( buf_trn-doc.hold-obj-code               ), input 0 ).
     2248           end.
     2249           run export-attribute in this-procedure (
