     2286           ).
     2287           run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "reasonCode"  ,  input v-reason-code  , input 2 ).
     2288           run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, input "comment"     ,  input v-doc-PS       , input 0 ).
     2289           run bgelib-tag-close in this-procedure ( input 0, input "doc" ).
     2290           if p-ext-doc-type <> 'ot':U
     2291           and p-pay-code = yes
