     2375               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, "VATr"          , input string( abs( buf_ot-tot-sale.vat-rubl       ) ), input 2 ).
     2376               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, "SLTr"          , input string( abs( buf_ot-tot-sale.slt-rubl       ) ), input 2 ).
