     2378               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, "transportr"    , input string( abs( buf_ot-tot-sale.transport-rubl ) ), input 2 ).
     2379               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 1, "otherr"        , input string( abs( buf_ot-tot-sale.other-rubl     ) ), input 2 ).
